    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_theme" kindref="compound">Theme</ref> state model — owns the live ValueTree of theme lua files. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads theme.lua and whelmed.lua from the active theme directory and rebuilds the live state tree. Used by <ref refid="classend_1_1_look_and_feel" kindref="compound">end::LookAndFeel</ref> for colour, font, and graphics resolution. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
